    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i want to bring anything back into focus. everything feels so heavy. honestly, it feels like fighting to keep the lights on is just more exhausting than just letting it go dark. it feels more peaceful to just... stop fighting it. like, why keep trying to fix a house that's already empty?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
